<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - UBS ups Oryx Energy to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - UBS ups Oryx Energy to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- UBS Securities said it boosted Oryx Energy Co to buy from hold.  </p>
<p>-- Analyst Michael Barbis also raised his estimates for Oryx's earnings and cash flow in 1997, his office said.</p>
<p>-- The UBS analyst boosted his earnings estimate for fiscal 1997 to $1.45 from $1.15 per share previously and for cash flow to $5.70 per share from $5.35, his office said.</p>
<p>-- His target price for the stock is $29 over the next 12 months. The stock was up 1/8 of a point to 21-7/8 in early trading Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- E. Auchard, Wall Street bureau, 212-859-1736</p>
</text>
